Browser Keywords

Open Browser →  open website
Close Browser → close browser
Maximize Browser Window → maximize screen
Go To → navigate to another URL


🔍 Element / Search Keywords

Click Element → click button/link
Input Text → type in textbox
Clear Element Text → clear input field
Press Keys → press keyboard keys (ENTER, TAB)


⏳ Wait Keywords (VERY IMPORTANT)

Wait Until Element Is Visible → wait until element appears
Wait Until Page Contains → wait for text
Wait Until Element Is Enabled → wait until clickable


👉 These are must-use to avoid failures
✅ Validation Keywords

Element Should Be Visible → check element visible

Page Should Contain → check text present

Element Text Should Be → verify exact text


🖱️ Mouse Actions

Double Click Element
Mouse Over
Drag And Drop


📄 Dropdown Keywords

Select From List By Label
Select From List By Value

📁 Other Useful Keywords

Sleep → wait (not recommended much ❌)
Capture Page Screenshot → take screenshot
Execute JavaScript → run JS code


⭐ Most Important (Top 10 MUST REMEMBER)

If you remember only these, you're safe:

